Specification CommonMark

DataType Markdown
Description Markdown source text.
Examples: ValidValues
| Value     | IsValid | Notes |
| Hello     | True    |       |
| # Heading | True    |       |
| **Bold**  | True    |       |

DataType Html
Description HTML produced from Markdown.
Examples: ValidValues
| Value            | IsValid | Notes |
| <p>Hello</p>     | True    |       |
| <h1>Heading</h1> | True    |       |

Attributes RenderingCases
| Name     | DataType |
| Markdown | Markdown |
| Result   | Html     |
| Notes    | String   |

ScenarioGroup Paragraphs

Calculation Render Paragraph
Description Plain text is rendered as a paragraph.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown    | Result             | Notes                  |
| Hello world | <p>Hello world</p> | Single line paragraph. |
| CommonMark  | <p>CommonMark</p>  | Simple text.           |

Calculation Preserve Spaces Within Paragraph
Description Spaces inside paragraph text are preserved.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown    | Result             | Notes                  |
| Hello world | <p>Hello world</p> | Single space retained. |

ScenarioGroup Headings

Calculation ATX Headings
Description Hash characters create ATX headings.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown    | Result           | Notes            |
| # Heading   | <h1>Heading</h1> | Level 1 heading. |
| ## Heading  | <h2>Heading</h2> | Level 2 heading. |
| ### Heading | <h3>Heading</h3> | Level 3 heading. |

Calculation Heading Text Is Parsed
Description Heading contents may contain inline formatting.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown    | Result                    | Notes                |
| # *Heading* | <h1><em>Heading</em></h1> | Emphasis in heading. |

ScenarioGroup Emphasis

Calculation Italic Emphasis
Description Single asterisks produce emphasis.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result               | Notes           |
| *text*   | <p><em>text</em></p> | Basic emphasis. |

Calculation Strong Emphasis
Description Double asterisks produce strong emphasis.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result                       | Notes            |
| **text** | <p><strong>text</strong></p> | Strong emphasis. |

Calculation Nested Emphasis
Description Emphasis may be nested.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown   | Result                                | Notes          |
| ***text*** | <p><em><strong>text</strong></em></p> | Nested markup. |

ScenarioGroup Links

Calculation Inline Link
Description A Markdown link renders as an HTML anchor.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown                    | Result                                        | Notes       |
| [CommonMark](https://a.com) | <p><a href="https://a.com">CommonMark</a></p> | Basic link. |

Calculation Link Inside Text
Description Links can appear within paragraph text.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown                          | Result                                              | Notes          |
| Visit [site](https://a.com) today | <p>Visit <a href="https://a.com">site</a> today</p> | Embedded link. |

ScenarioGroup Lists

Calculation Unordered List
Description Dash-prefixed items create an unordered list.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result                        | Notes          |
| - A\n- B | <ul><li>A</li><li>B</li></ul> | Two-item list. |

Calculation Ordered List
Description Number-prefixed items create an ordered list.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown   | Result                        | Notes         |
| 1. A\n2. B | <ol><li>A</li><li>B</li></ol> | Ordered list. |

ScenarioGroup Code

Calculation Inline Code
Description Backticks create inline code.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result                   | Notes        |
| `code`   | <p><code>code</code></p> | Inline code. |

Calculation Fenced Code Block
Description Triple backticks create a code block.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown      | Result                        | Notes              |
| ```\nabc\n``` | <pre><code>abc\n</code></pre> | Fenced code block. |

ScenarioGroup BlockQuotes

Calculation Block Quote
Description Greater-than signs create block quotes.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result                                 | Notes         |
| > quoted | <blockquote><p>quoted</p></blockquote> | Simple quote. |

ScenarioGroup Escaping

Calculation Escaped Formatting Characters
Description Escaped characters are rendered literally.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result | Notes | Asterisk not interpreted. |

ScenarioGroup Horizontal Rules

Calculation Horizontal Rule
Description Three consecutive dashes create a thematic break.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown | Result | Notes            |
| ---      | <hr /> | Horizontal rule. |

ScenarioGroup Mixed Examples

Calculation Paragraph With Link And Emphasis
Description Multiple inline constructs may be combined.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown                  | Result                                          | Notes              |
| Visit *our* https://a.com | <p>Visit <em>our</em> https://a.comsite</a></p> | Combined features. |

Calculation List With Emphasis
Description Inline formatting may appear inside list items.
Examples: RenderingCases
| Markdown           | Result                                                      | Notes            |
| - *one*\n- **two** | <ul><li><em>one</em></li><li><strong>two</strong></li></ul> | Rich list items. |